            {
                "comment": "Although she is clearly very smart, she is not great at running a class. Exams deviated from what we had seen in class which resulted in terrible averages. Often lectured for over half of the 70 minute period when the activity is written to take the full 70 minutes. Overall one of the worst experiences I have had in a class",
